{"page":412,"verses":[{"verse_key":"31:12","surah":31,"ayah":12,"ar_uthmani":"وَلَقَدْ ءَاتَيْنَا لُقْمَـٰنَ ٱلْحِكْمَةَ أَنِ ٱشْكُرْ لِلَّهِ ۚ وَمَن يَشْكُرْ فَإِنَّمَا يَشْكُرُ لِنَفْسِهِۦ ۖ وَمَن كَفَرَ فَإِنَّ ٱللَّهَ غَنِىٌّ حَمِيدٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"We endowed Luqman with wisdom: ‘Be thankful to God: whoever gives thanks benefits his own soul, and as for those who are thankless––God is self-sufficient, worthy of all praise.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلَقَدْ","en_gloss":"And verily","transliteration":"walaqad","verse_key":"31:12"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ءَاتَيْنَا","en_gloss":"We gave","transliteration":"ātaynā","verse_key":"31:12"},{"pos":3,"ar":"لُقْمَـٰنَ","en_gloss":"Luqman","transliteration":"luq'māna","verse_key":"31:12"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلْحِكْمَةَ","en_gloss":"the wisdom","transliteration":"l-ḥik'mata","verse_key":"31:12"},{"pos":5,"ar":"أَنِ","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"ani","verse_key":"31:12"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱشْكُرْ","en_gloss":"Be grateful","transliteration":"ush'kur","verse_key":"31:12"},{"pos":7,"ar":"لِلَّهِ ۚ","en_gloss":"to Allah","transliteration":"lillahi","verse_key":"31:12"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَمَن","en_gloss":"And whoever","transliteration":"waman","verse_key":"31:12"},{"pos":9,"ar":"يَشْكُرْ","en_gloss":"(is) grateful","transliteration":"yashkur","verse_key":"31:12"},{"pos":10,"ar":"فَإِنَّمَا","en_gloss":"then only","transliteration":"fa-innamā","verse_key":"31:12"},{"pos":11,"ar":"يَشْكُرُ","en_gloss":"he is grateful","transliteration":"yashkuru","verse_key":"31:12"},{"pos":12,"ar":"لِنَفْسِهِۦ ۖ","en_gloss":"for himself","transliteration":"linafsihi","verse_key":"31:12"},{"pos":13,"ar":"وَمَن","en_gloss":"And whoever","transliteration":"waman","verse_key":"31:12"},{"pos":14,"ar":"كَفَرَ","en_gloss":"(is) ungrateful","transliteration":"kafara","verse_key":"31:12"},{"pos":15,"ar":"فَإِنَّ","en_gloss":"then indeed","transliteration":"fa-inna","verse_key":"31:12"},{"pos":16,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-l