transliteration":"ʿaẓīmun","verse_key":"31:13"},{"pos":15,"ar":"١٣","en_gloss":"(13)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"31:13"}]},{"verse_key":"31:14","surah":31,"ayah":14,"ar_uthmani":"وَوَصَّيْنَا ٱلْإِنسَـٰنَ بِوَٰلِدَيْهِ حَمَلَتْهُ أُمُّهُۥ وَهْنًا عَلَىٰ وَهْنٍ وَفِصَـٰلُهُۥ فِى عَامَيْنِ أَنِ ٱشْكُرْ لِى وَلِوَٰلِدَيْكَ إِلَىَّ ٱلْمَصِيرُ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"We have commanded people to be good to their parents: their mothers carried them, with strain upon strain, and it takes two years to wean them. Give thanks to Me and to your parents- all will return to Me.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَوَصَّيْنَا","en_gloss":"And We have enjoined","transliteration":"wawaṣṣaynā","verse_key":"31:14"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلْإِنسَـٰنَ","en_gloss":"(upon) man","transliteration":"l-insāna","verse_key":"31:14"},{"pos":3,"ar":"بِوَٰلِدَيْهِ","en_gloss":"for his parents ","transliteration":"biwālidayhi","verse_key":"31:14"},{"pos":4,"ar":"حَمَلَتْهُ","en_gloss":"carried him","transliteration":"ḥamalathu","verse_key":"31:14"},{"pos":5,"ar":"أُمُّهُۥ","en_gloss":"his mother","transliteration":"ummuhu","verse_key":"31:14"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَهْنًا","en_gloss":"(in) weakness","transliteration":"wahnan","verse_key":"31:14"},{"pos":7,"ar":"عَلَىٰ","en_gloss":"upon","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"31:14"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَهْنٍۢ","en_gloss":"weakness","transliteration":"wahnin","verse_key":"31:14"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَفِصَـٰلُهُۥ","en_gloss":"and his weaning","transliteration":"wafiṣāluhu","verse_key":"31:14"},{"pos":10,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"(is) in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"31:14"},{"pos":11,"ar":"عَامَيْنِ","en_gloss":"two years","transliteration":"ʿāmayni","verse_key":"31:14"},{"pos":12,"ar":"أَنِ","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"ani","verse_key":"31:14"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ٱشْكُرْ","en_gloss":"Be grateful","transliteration":"ush'kur","verse_key":"31:14"},{"pos":14,"ar":"لِى","en_gloss":"to Me","transliteration":"lī","verse_key":"31:14"},{"pos":15,"ar":"وَلِوَٰلِدَيْكَ